WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.603 --> 00:00:16.523
ducked behind a fence.

2
00:00:19.545 --> 00:00:21.086
A moment later she was Rocket Girl!

3
00:00:21.106 --> 00:00:23.287
"Okay," said Roxy.

4
00:00:23.307 --> 00:00:26.929
"It's time to save Metro City from those dinosaurs!"

5
00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:29.130
She blasted into the air.

6
00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:32.092
"Look!" cried Mara.

7
00:00:32.776 --> 00:00:33.937
"It's Rocket Girl!"

8
00:00:34.677 --> 00:00:37.459
Terrell stared suspiciously at the flying superhero.

9
00:00:41.082 --> 00:00:44.564
When Roxy arrived in downtown Metro City, dinosaurs were everywhere.

10
00:00:44.584 --> 00:00:48.487
"Oh no!

11
00:00:49.327 --> 00:00:51.669
Dinosaurs!" yelled an old man.

12
00:00:51.689 --> 00:00:54.410
"Rocket Girl, do something!"

13
00:00:54.671 --> 00:00:55.811
cried a woman with a baby.

14
00:00:56.932 --> 00:00:58.413
Boom! Boom!

15
00:00:59.494 --> 00:01:02.536
Two large dinosaurs with long necks stomped along West Street.

16
00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:05.281
A car tried to race away from them.

17
00:01:07.123 --> 00:01:08.644
It crashed into a store window.

18
00:01:11.226 --> 00:01:12.467
The driver got out and ran.

19
00:01:12.487 --> 00:01:15.290
"Whoa!" said Roxy.

20
00:01:15.310 --> 00:01:16.991
"This is bad!"

21
00:01:18.012 --> 00:01:19.393
She heard a familiar voice.

22
00:01:19.413 --> 00:01:21.314
"Rocket Girl!"

23
00:01:21.895 --> 00:01:22.956
It was Detective Smith.

24
00:01:23.997 --> 00:01:26.439
He and two other police officers were hiding in an alley.

25
00:01:27.339 --> 00:01:28.260
Roxy ran to them.

26
00:01:28.280 --> 00:01:32.764
"Ahh!" Roxy pretended to be scared.

27
00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:37.183
"It's another dinosaur—dressed as a detective!"

28
00:01:38.023 --> 00:01:39.304
Detective Smith frowned.

29
00:01:39.324 --> 00:01:42.867
"This is no time for jokes, Rocket Girl."

30
00:01:42.887 --> 00:01:45.529
"I know," said Roxy.

31
00:01:45.549 --> 00:01:48.331
"So where did the dinosaurs come from?"

32
00:01:48.351 --> 00:01:51.373
"I have no idea," said the detective.

33
00:01:51.393 --> 00:01:55.856
"Early this morning electricity lit up the sky for a moment.

34
00:01:56.897 --> 00:01:58.639
After that the dinosaurs appeared."

35
00:01:59.659 --> 00:02:03.929
Crash! Several small dinosaurs knocked over a hot dog cart.

36
00:02:03.949 --> 00:02:06.489
"My hot dogs are ruined!"

37
00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:07.850
cried the hot dog man.

38
00:02:07.870 --> 00:02:12.371
Grr! One dinosaur growled at the man.

39
00:02:12.391 --> 00:02:16.392
"Aah!" The man screamed and ran away.

40
00:02:17.432 --> 00:02:19.473
The dinosaurs gobbled up all the hot dogs.

41
00:02:21.314 --> 00:02:24.174
A flying dinosaur swooped down and ate an old woman's hat.

42
00:02:24.194 --> 00:02:27.855
"Gah!" the woman cried.

43
00:02:28.696 --> 00:02:30.216
She waved her cane at the dinosaur.

44
00:02:31.188 --> 00:02:33.370
Just then a large shadow fell over the woman.

45
00:02:34.271 --> 00:02:34.851
It was a T.

46
00:02:34.951 --> 00:02:37.954
rex! The woman stopped waving her cane.

47
00:02:41.697 --> 00:02:43.118
Girl! Help me!"

48
00:02:43.339 --> 00:02:43.899
she cried.

49
00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:47.682
Zoom! Roxy shot toward the woman.

50
00:02:48.543 --> 00:02:51.526
The dinosaur opened its jaws Swoosh!

51
00:02:52.446 --> 00:02:54.428
Roxy swept up the woman just in time.

52
00:02:55.389 --> 00:02:58.712
Roar! The huge dinosaur stomped on a car.

53
00:03:00.796 --> 00:03:02.177
"My new car!"

54
00:03:02.418 --> 00:03:03.419
cried a man in a suit.

55
00:03:03.439 --> 00:03:06.721
"That car cost a lot of money!"

56
00:03:07.742 --> 00:03:08.063
The T.

57
00:03:08.123 --> 00:03:09.044
rex spun around.

58
00:03:10.084 --> 00:03:10.925
It sniffed the air.

59
00:03:12.106 --> 00:03:13.688
Then it ran toward a school bus.

60
00:03:13.708 --> 00:03:17.191
"Uh-oh!" said Roxy.

61
00:03:18.652 --> 00:03:20.213
She flew as fast as she could.

62
00:03:21.675 --> 00:03:27.988
She picked up the bus and moved it far from the T.

63
00:03:28.008 --> 00:03:28.248
rex. Roar!

64
00:03:28.268 --> 00:03:28.889
Finally, the T.

65
00:03:28.969 --> 00:03:30.530
rex turned and ran down the street.

66
00:03:35.855 --> 00:03:36.495
said Roxy.

67
00:03:36.515 --> 00:03:38.537
"I'm glad that T.

68
00:03:38.637 --> 00:03:39.798
rex is running away."

69
00:03:41.319 --> 00:03:42.440
But then she gulped.

70
00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:44.182
"Oh no!

71
00:03:44.962 --> 00:03:47.264
The dinosaur is running down Mountain Street.

72
00:03:48.105 --> 00:03:51.248
That street leads to Metro City Elementary School!"
